# ============================================================
#  المكتبة الإلكترونية — environment variables
#  Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and adjust.
# ============================================================

# --- Admin demo gate (FRONT-END ONLY, not real security) ---
# Used by the local browser CMS login screen. Change these before any
# real deployment, and prefer moving auth to Supabase (see below).
VITE_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@maktaba.local
VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin1234

# --- Supabase (optional, for the real backend) ---
# Only the anon (public) key belongs in the frontend. NEVER put the
# service_role key or any secret in VITE_* variables — they ship to the browser.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY

# --- External file storage (PDF/EPUB) ---
# The app is provider-independent: each file is just a public download URL saved
# in the DB (OneDrive, Up-4ever, FileInk, RapidFiles, FileFire, Supabase, or any
# external URL). No key is needed for URL-based providers.
#
# If you later add an OFFICIAL API adapter (e.g. OneDrive via Microsoft Graph, or
# a PPD provider API), its secrets MUST stay server-side only (Netlify/Edge
# Functions, Supabase Edge Functions) — never in VITE_* vars.
# Example (server runtime only, NOT VITE_):
# MS_GRAPH_CLIENT_ID=...
# MS_GRAPH_CLIENT_SECRET=...   # server-side function only
